{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02→S04→S07：在舍不得从前的好、觉得当初不该受委屈，以及怀疑离开是否正确之间摆动。尤其S04和S07都重新追问当初是否该走、如果早知道会孤单还会不会走，存在一定重复。\",\n    \"S07→S09→S10→S11：在想找回亲近、害怕孤单和不愿重新忍让之间摆动。不过S09逐渐辨清想回去的动机，S10进一步怀疑回去能否恢复从前，S11则开始形成暂缓回头、先过好眼下的打算，整体有推进。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02→S04→S07：在舍不得从前的好、怀疑离开是否正确、不愿回去重新忍让之间反复摆动。S04已经提出怕回去又得忍让，S07又重新讲想找回亲近却不甘心再受那些气，冲突内容比较接近。\",\n    \"S03→S06→S08→S10：反复回到想起亲近时既温暖又酸楚的感受。S06增加了独自面对困难的具体认识，S08增加了回忆无法陪伴现实的认识，但S10又用“一想起那份亲近，心里又暖又酸”重新呈现已经出现过的情绪，没有充分向前推进。\",\n    \"S07→S09→S10→S11：在想回去、害怕孤单、不愿重新忍让之间摆动。虽然最后逐渐形成暂不回头的打算，但前面几段的心理拉扯较为重复。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条的整体结构和主要心理冲突基本相同，区别集中在S10：X从反复想念推进到新的判断——即使回去，也未必能恢复从前的亲近；Y则再次描写想起亲近时的暖和酸，重复了前面已经出现的情绪。因此Y更像在原有感受中打转，X的心理探索多了一步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2be0fef3-edd5-4607-857a-313a7cb8b1c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T102503981326Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:25:47.926920+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1c65a52382487e2c360f6598f896df7940934a2f2ec34256f89dde8e4cc71b21", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T102503981326Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f2219b3ef64d9d5407e40da97f048eaf14af0fa99525d7fec268586abfef7dff"}}}
